Note on the Spine Runtimes
--------------------------

This crate depends on the `spine_runtime` crate, a port of Esoteric Software's
spine-cpp that is distributed under the Spine Runtimes License Agreement, not
under MIT. Software built with this crate includes `spine_runtime` and is bound
by that license: every user of it needs their own Spine Editor license. See
https://esotericsoftware.com/spine-runtimes-license.

The MIT terms above apply only to the source code in this repository.
